Adapted from the best-selling console hit and built specifically for tablets and smartphones the game allows up to four-player multiplayer, and, as a new addition to both platforms, voice chat. It also features ranks based on Experience Points.

It includes the maps Kino der Toten, Ascension, and Call of the Dead: Director''s Cut as well as the unlockable Dead Ops Arcade.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/call-of-duty-black-ops-zombies', '["Android", "iOS"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 1.06, '2026-08-07 03:39:39', '2026-08-07 03:39:39');
